#ASSERT `s 7 -- may they get a health status report about me` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `ASKED OTHER` FALSE TRUE `INCOMPETENT` TRUE `SIGNED GUARDIAN` TRUE EQUALS `HSR YES`
#ASSERT `s 7 -- may they get a health status report about me` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `ASKED OTHER` FALSE TRUE `DEAD WITH REP` TRUE `SIGNED REP` TRUE EQUALS `HSR YES`

