§ `The privacy principles (principles 4.1, 6, 7)`

#ASSERT `principle 6 cl 4 -- can I be required to get or hand over my own record` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`principle 6 cl 4 -- can I be required to get or hand over my own record` FALSE)

#ASSERT `principle 7 cl 3 -- must my statement be added to my record` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`principle 7 cl 3 -- must my statement be added to my record` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`principle 7 cl 3 -- must my statement be added to my record` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`principle 7 cl 3 -- must my statement be added to my record` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)

-- Born 15 June 2000, treated as a child: turns 25 on 15 June 2025; destruction from 16 June 2025.
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- the first day my record may be destroyed for age or time` TRUE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` EQUALS `16 Jun 2025`
-- An adult last seen 10 March 2019: 7 years after is 10 March 2026; destruction from 11 March 2026.
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- the first day my record may be destroyed for age or time` FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` EQUALS `11 Mar 2026`
-- Fork F3: born 29 February 2004, turns 25 on 1 March 2029; from 2 March 2029. Last seen 29 February 2020: 1 March 2027; from 2 March 2027.
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- the first day my record may be destroyed for age or time` TRUE `29 Feb 2004` `10 Mar 2019` EQUALS `2 Mar 2029`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- the first day my record may be destroyed for age or time` FALSE `29 Feb 2004` `29 Feb 2020` EQUALS `2 Mar 2027`

-- Arguments: territory law, other law prohibits, under 18, born, last service, electronic copy, footage, today.
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE FALSE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` FALSE FALSE `10 Mar 2026` EQUALS `KEEP IT`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE FALSE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` FALSE FALSE `11 Mar 2026` EQUALS `DESTROY TIME`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE TRUE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` FALSE FALSE `11 Mar 2026` EQUALS `KEEP IT`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` TRUE FALSE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` FALSE FALSE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `DESTROY LAW`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE FALSE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` TRUE FALSE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `DESTROY COPY`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE TRUE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` TRUE FALSE `20 Mar 2026` EQUALS `DESTROY COPY`
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE FALSE FALSE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` FALSE TRUE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `DESTROY FOOTAGE`
-- Under 18 at collection, born 15 June 2000: kept on 15 June 2025 is not after the birthday; on 16 June 2025 it may go.
#ASSERT `principle 4.1 -- may my record be destroyed` FALSE FALSE TRUE `15 Jun 2000` `10 Mar 2019` FALSE FALSE `16 Jun 2025` EQUALS `DESTROY TIME`

§ `Practice relocation or closure (principle 11)`

-- Closing on 30 April 2026: told by 31 March 2026.
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I be told the practice is moving or closing` `30 Apr 2026` EQUALS `31 Mar 2026`
-- Notice published 2 March: request by 16 March.
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I make my transfer request` `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `16 Mar 2026`
-- Arguments: published, request received, urgent, fee payable, fee paid, paid on.
