#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I get my record` `2 Mar 2026` `17 Mar 2026` FALSE FALSE FALSE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `NO DUTY`
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I get my record` `2 Mar 2026` `10 Mar 2026` TRUE FALSE FALSE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `due by` `17 Mar 2026`
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I get my record` `2 Mar 2026` `10 Mar 2026` FALSE TRUE FALSE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `NO FEE DAY`
-- Fee paid 12 April: 19 April is later than 9 April (30 days after 10 March).
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I get my record` `2 Mar 2026` `10 Mar 2026` FALSE TRUE TRUE `12 Apr 2026` EQUALS `due by` `19 Apr 2026`
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I get my record` `2 Mar 2026` `10 Mar 2026` FALSE TRUE TRUE `15 Mar 2026` EQUALS `due by` `9 Apr 2026`
-- Urgent services and an unpaid fee: the 7 days stand (cl 6).
#ASSERT `principle 11 -- by when must I get my record` `2 Mar 2026` `10 Mar 2026` TRUE TRUE FALSE `2 Mar 2026` EQUALS `due by` `17 Mar 2026`

