§ `Complaints, the court and offences (ss 18, 20-23, 31, 32)`

#ASSERT `s 18 -- can I complain to the commission` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 18 -- can I complain to the commission` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 18 -- can I complain to the commission` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 31 -- can I apply to the Magistrates Court` `a declaration that something done under the Act was or was not validly done` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31 -- can I apply to the Magistrates Court` `a declaration that something done under the Act was or was not validly done` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31 -- can I apply to the Magistrates Court` `something else I want` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 32 -- can I appeal to the Supreme Court` `made, varied or revoked a declaration or order under s 31` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32 -- can I appeal to the Supreme Court` `refused to make, vary or revoke a declaration or order under s 31` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32 -- can I appeal to the Supreme Court` `made, varied or revoked a declaration or order under s 31` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32 -- can I appeal to the Supreme Court` `something else the court did` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- 50 penalty units: $160 x 50 = $8 000 for an individual; $810 x 50 = $40 500 for a corporation.
#ASSERT `ss 20-23 -- the most they can be fined` `threatened, intimidated or recklessly misled me so that I would not make or pursue, or would withdraw, a request for access (s 23)` FALSE EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `ss 20-23 -- the most they can be fined` `falsely told me I was legally required to consent to a health status report (s 20 (4))` TRUE EQUALS JUST 40500
#ASSERT `ss 20-23 -- the most they can be fined` `something else they did` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
